flowchart LR
  subgraph workers [Rollout workers]
    nextId[Next task id]
    capture[Capture policy and version]
    generate[generate_group]
    nextId --> capture --> generate
  end

  queue[Bounded queue]
  generate -->|put| queue

  subgraph learner [Learner step]
    collect[Collect until groups_per_batch fresh]
    stale{version minus policy_version greater than max_staleness}
    sequences{Any sequences}
    update[update then publish version plus 1]
    skip[Skip update]
    record[record_training]
    evalDue{eval_due}
    schedule[Schedule run_evaluation]
    nextStep[Next step or stop workers]
    collect --> stale
    stale -->|yes, drop| collect
    stale -->|no, keep| sequences
    sequences -->|yes| update --> record
    sequences -->|no| skip --> record
    record --> evalDue
    evalDue -->|yes| schedule --> nextStep
    evalDue -->|no| nextStep
  end

  queue -->|get| collect
  update -.->|new policy| capture
